\noindent
{\bf Application to a step-index waveguide:}
The UPE (\ref{eq:upe1},\ref{eq:upe2}) is general. It can be applied to a homogeneous (step-index) MMF, where  $A_{mp}(\omega) =\alpha(\omega) \delta_{mp}$ with $\alpha(\omega) =(\omega^2/c^2) \big( {n}^2(\omega) - {n}^2(\omega_o) \big)$.
In this case ${\tilde \beta}_m(\omega)$ and $\Gamma_m(\omega)$ recover the expressions (2)-(3).
