\begin{theorem}\label{TPP}
  Let $d$ be any metric on the space $\cN\oooox$ that induces the vague
  topology.
Then
\begin{equation}\label{tpp}
d\bigpar{\set{M_{n,i}-b_n}_{i=1}^n\,,\,
\set{\lceil\xi_i+ (e-1)\tau+c_n)\rceil}_{i=1}^\infty}\to 0.
