to the following equivalent version.
\begin{theorem}\label{TPPs} For every $r\in{\mathbb Z}$
\begin{equation}\label{tppS}
d_{\rm TV} \bigpar{{\rm M}_n^{\tau_n-\alpha_n}|_{[r,\infty]}, \Xi^\uparrow_{(e-1)\tau+c_n}|_{[r,\infty]}}\to 0.
\end{equation}
\end{theorem}

