    \caption{Magnetic field and flow profiles for $a_{e}=-40.0$, $a_{p}=4.0$, $a_{h}=4.5$, $a_{i}=51.2$, $\chi=2$ , $\varepsilon=0.1$, and $\xi=0.9$. }
