As we will see below, analyzing the properties of decomposition (\ref{eq:conmut-diagrama}) becomes more intricate when the metric topologies $d_{AW}$ and $d_{AW^r}$ on  $\mathcal{K}_0^d$ and $\mathcal{S}_{rc}^d$, respectively, are considered.

